rule VibrationLimit
	statement: A machine whose vibration exceeds its VibMaxMmS limit is in critical condition and needs a corrective work order; rising vibration on an air compressor usually indicates bearing wear.
	lineageTag: 23438648-a44f-4ba3-a881-5cb508f0e685

	ruleReferencedEntity Machine
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty VibrationMmS

		ruleReferencedProperty VibMaxMmS

		ruleReferencedProperty MachineType

	ruleReferencedEntity WorkOrder

	ruleReferencedRelationship 'Work Order For Machine'
